{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54260","headline":"偈 一 · 元安","name":"偈 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"决志归乡去，乘船渡五湖。\n举篙星月隐，停棹日轮孤。\n解缆离邪岸，张帆出正途。\n到来家荡尽，免作屋中愚。\n（《五灯会元》卷六）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元安","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54260.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54260","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}